<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sistema para la Gestión de Trayectorias Socioemocionales — Colegio Raíces de Gonnet</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<style>
  :root{
    --primary:#2A327B;
    --primary-dark:#1c2158;
    --primary-light:#4a53b0;
    --accent:#38A935;
    --accent-dark:#2c8a29;
    --bg:#eef0f8;
    --card:#ffffff;
    --text:#181c3a;
    --text-light:#5b5f78;
    --border:#d6d8ea;
    --danger:#c0392b;
    --danger-bg:#fdecea;
    --warning:#b8720b;
    --warning-bg:#fdf3e0;
    --ok-bg:#eafaf1;
    --ok-border:#bdeecb;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4{color:var(--primary);margin-top:0;}
  a{color:var(--primary);}
  button{font-family:inherit;}
  input,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;}

  /* ---------- LOGIN ---------- */
  #login-screen{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--primary) 0%,var(--primary-dark) 100%);
    padding:20px;
  }
  .login-card{
    background:var(--card);
    padding:36px 34px;
    border-radius:14px;
    width:400px;
    max-width:100%;
    box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    text-align:center;
  }
  .login-card img.logo{width:78px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;}
  .login-card h2{margin-bottom:2px;}
  .login-card p.sub{color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.88rem;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .login-card input{width:100%;padding:11px;margin-bottom:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:0.95rem;}
  .login-card select{width:100%;padding:11px;margin-bottom:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:0.95rem;background:#fff;}
  .login-card .btn-primary{width:100%;}
  .login-error{color:var(--danger);font-size:0.85rem;margin:-4px 0 12px 0;min-height:16px;}
  .login-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.83rem;color:var(--primary-light);cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;}
  .login-help{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-light);margin-top:16px;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;background:#f6f7fc;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;}

  /* ---------- SHELL ---------- */
  #app-shell{display:none;min-height:100vh;flex-direction:column;}
  header.topbar{
    background:var(--primary);
    color:#fff;
    padding:10px 22px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
  }
  .topbar-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .topbar-left img{width:38px;height:38px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;}
  .topbar-left .titles h1{color:#fff;font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;line-height:1.2;}
  .topbar-left .titles small{color:#c9cdf0;font-size:0.72rem;}
  nav.topnav{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  nav.topnav button{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border:none;color:#e7e8fb;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:7px;
    cursor:pointer;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;transition:.15s;
  }
  nav.topnav button:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);}
  nav.topnav button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
  .topbar-right{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}
  .btn-lock{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);color:#fff;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.8rem;}
  .btn-lock:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}

  .backup-banner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;padding:7px 16px;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;color:#fff;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .backup-banner .btn{padding:4px 10px;font-size:0.72rem;}
  .banner-ok{background:var(--accent-dark);}
  .banner-warn{background:var(--warning);}
  .banner-danger{background:var(--danger);}

  .app-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:18px;max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;}
  @media (max-width:820px){.app-body{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  /* Las secciones que no usan el listado de estudiantes (Inicio, Perfil Grupal,
     Orientación Vocacional, Configuración, Ayuda) ocultan el aside y necesitan que
     el grid pase a una sola columna a todo el ancho; si no, el panel principal
     queda anclado a grid-column:2 y deja un gutter vacío de 300px a la izquierda. */
  .app-body.full-width{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  aside.sidebar{grid-column:1;background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);height:fit-content;}
  main.mainpanel{grid-column:2;}
  .app-body.full-width main.mainpanel{grid-column:1;}
  @media (max-width:820px){aside.sidebar,main.mainpanel{grid-column:1;}}
  aside.sidebar h3{font-size:0.95rem;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .sidebar input[type=text]{width:100%;padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:0.88rem;}
  .sidebar select{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:0.85rem;}
  .sidebar-check{font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-light);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;}
  ul.student-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;max-height:52vh;overflow-y:auto;}
  .student-item{padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:7px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;position:relative;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;}
  .student-item:hover{border-color:var(--primary-light);}
  .student-item.active{background:#eef0fb;border-color:var(--primary);}
  .student-item strong{font-size:0.9rem;display:block;}
  .student-item small{color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.76rem;}
  .student-item .st-badge{position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;font-size:0.65rem;background:#f1f1f1;color:#777;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px;}
  .student-item .alert-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--danger);flex-shrink:0;position:absolute;top:10px;right:8px;}
  .avatar{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;background:#dde0f5;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--primary);font-weight:800;font-size:0.8rem;}
  .avatar-lg{width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:14px;object-fit:cover;background:#dde0f5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--primary);font-weight:800;font-size:1.6rem;}
  .sidebar-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;}

  main.mainpanel{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);min-height:60vh;}
  .empty-state{color:var(--text-light);text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;}

  .student-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .student-header .id-block{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;}
  .student-header h2{margin:0;font-size:1.35rem;}
  .student-header .meta{color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:4px;}
  .badge{display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3px;}
  .badge-active{background:var(--ok-bg);color:var(--accent-dark);border:1px solid var(--ok-border);}
  .badge-inactive{background:#f1f1f1;color:#777;border:1px solid #ddd;}
  .badge-danger{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger);border:1px solid #f2c6c1;}
  .badge-warn{background:var(--warning-bg);color:var(--warning);border:1px solid #f1d9a8;}
  .header-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .tab-btn{padding:9px 16px;border:none;background:none;font-weight:700;color:#8a8ea6;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;font-size:0.87rem;}
  .tab-btn.active{color:var(--primary);border-bottom-color:var(--accent);}
  .tab-content{display:none;}
  .tab-content.active{display:block;}

  /* forms */
  .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}
  .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}
  .grid-4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
  @media (max-width:700px){.grid-2,.grid-3,.grid-4{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .form-group{margin-bottom:14px;}
  .form-group label{display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text);}
  .form-group .hint{font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-light);margin-top:3px;}
  input[type=text],input[type=number],input[type=date],input[type=password],select,textarea{
    width:100%;padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;font-size:0.88rem;background:#fff;color:var(--text);
  }
  textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:70px;}
  fieldset{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:18px;}
  legend{font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);padding:0 8px;font-size:0.92rem;}
  .legend-sub{font-size:0.76rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--text-light);display:block;margin-top:2px;}

  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem;transition:.15s;}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--primary-light);}
  .btn-accent{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
  .btn-accent:hover{background:var(--accent-dark);}
  .btn-outline{background:#fff;color:var(--primary);border:1.5px solid var(--primary);}
  .btn-outline:hover{background:#f1f2fb;}
  .btn-danger{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger);border:1px solid #f2c6c1;}
  .btn-danger:hover{background:#f9d8d4;}
  .btn-sm{padding:5px 10px;font-size:0.76rem;border-radius:6px;}
  .btn-block{width:100%;justify-content:center;}
  .btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;}

  /* alert timeline */
  .alert-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden;border-left:5px solid var(--text-light);}
  .alert-card.grav-alta{border-left-color:var(--danger);}
  .alert-card.grav-media{border-left-color:var(--warning);}
  .alert-card.grav-baja{border-left-color:var(--accent);}
  .alert-card.resuelta{opacity:0.65;}
  .alert-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#f7f8fc;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
  .alert-body{padding:12px 14px;font-size:0.87rem;line-height:1.5;}
  .alert-tag{font-weight:800;font-size:0.72rem;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef0fb;color:var(--primary);}

  /* year/record cards */
  .year-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden;}
  .year-card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 16px;background:#f7f8fc;cursor:pointer;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
  .year-card-head .left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .year-pill{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:0.78rem;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:14px;}
  .year-card-body{padding:14px 16px;display:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
  .year-card-body.open{display:block;}
  .yc-field{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:0.86rem;}
  .yc-field b{display:block;color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;margin-bottom:2px;}
  .yc-obs{background:var(--warning-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--warning);padding:9px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.85rem;}
  .riasec-pill{background:#eef0fb;color:var(--primary);border:1px solid #d5d8f2;font-weight:800;font-size:0.75rem;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:14px;letter-spacing:1px;}
  .sovi-pill{background:#eafaf1;color:var(--accent-dark);border:1px solid var(--ok-border);font-weight:800;font-size:0.72rem;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:14px;}

  /* orientación vocacional: carreras */
  .num-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px 14px;}
  @media (max-width:700px){.num-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  .num-field label{font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;display:block;}
  .career-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .career-card .cname{font-weight:700;font-size:0.95rem;}
  .career-card .cinst{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-light);margin-top:2px;}
  .match-badge{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:0.95rem;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:10px;min-width:64px;text-align:center;}

  /* bars */
  .bar-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr 80px;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:0.82rem;}
  .bar-track{background:#eceef7;border-radius:6px;height:16px;overflow:hidden;}
  .bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:6px;}
  .bar-val{text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-light);}

  .hero-trayectoria{background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-dark) 100%);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px;margin-bottom:22px;text-align:center;}
  .hero-trayectoria h2{color:#fff;margin:0;}
  .hero-trayectoria p{color:#d7daf0;}
  .hero-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:14px;}
  .hero-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;min-width:78px;}
  .hero-stage.endpoint{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.30);}
  .hero-count{font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1;}
  .hero-arrow{font-size:1.2rem;color:#c9cdf0;padding:0 2px;}

  .nivel-filtro-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:2px 0 14px 0;}
  .nivel-filtro-row h3{margin:0;}
  .nivel-filtro-row .filtro-nivel-select{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-light);}
  .nivel-filtro-row select{padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:0.85rem;background:#fff;}

  .quick-actions-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:16px 0 28px 0;}
  .quick-action-btn{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:22px 14px;border:2px solid var(--primary);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;font-size:0.95rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s;}
  .quick-action-btn:hover{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;}
  .quick-action-icon{font-size:1.8rem;line-height:1;}

  .informe-collapse{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;margin-top:6px;}
  .informe-collapse > summary{cursor:pointer;padding:14px 18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
  .informe-collapse > summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .informe-collapse > summary::after{content:'Ver más ▾';font-weight:400;font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-light);}
  .informe-collapse[open] > summary::after{content:'Ocultar ▴';}
  .informe-collapse > .informe-box{border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:0;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;}
  .stat-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;background:#fff;text-align:center;}
  .stat-card .stat-value{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);}
  .stat-card .stat-label{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-light);margin-top:4px;}

  .likert-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:0.86rem;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;}
  .likert-row select{margin:0;}

  .sociograma-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:#fbfbfe;}
  .status-pill{font-weight:800;font-size:0.7rem;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;}
  .status-Popular{background:#eafaf1;color:var(--accent-dark);border:1px solid var(--ok-border);}
  .status-Rechazado{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger);border:1px solid #f2c6c1;}
  .status-Aislado{background:#f1f1f1;color:#777;border:1px solid #ddd;}
  .status-Controvertido{background:var(--warning-bg);color:var(--warning);border:1px solid #f1d9a8;}
  .status-Promedio{background:#eef0fb;color:var(--primary);border:1px solid #d5d8f2;}

  .informe-box{background:var(--ok-bg);border:1px solid var(--ok-border);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);padding:18px 20px;border-radius:8px;line-height:1.65;font-size:0.93rem;}
  .informe-box h4{margin-top:0;color:var(--accent-dark);}
  .informe-meta{color:var(--text-light);font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:14px;}

  table.admin-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.84rem;}
  table.admin-table th,table.admin-table td{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;}
  table.admin-table th{background:#f7f8fc;}
  .table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;}

  .modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,12,30,0.55);z-index:200;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;}
  .modal.open{display:flex;}
  .modal-content{background:#fff;padding:26px;border-radius:12px;width:480px;max-width:100%;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);}
  .modal-content.wide{width:720px;}
  .modal-content h3{margin-top:0;}
  .modal-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:18px;}

  .toast{position:fixed;bottom:20px;right:20px;background:var(--primary-dark);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.85rem;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);z-index:400;opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:.25s;pointer-events:none;}
  .toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

  .help-section{margin-bottom:22px;}
  .help-section h3{border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:6px;}
  .help-section p, .help-section li{font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text);}
  .warn-box{background:var(--warning-bg);border:1px solid #f1d9a8;border-left:5px solid var(--warning);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.85rem;margin:12px 0;}

  #print-header{display:none;}

  @media print{
    body{background:#fff;}
    header.topbar, aside.sidebar, .tabs, .header-actions, .no-print, .sidebar-actions, .btn{display:none !important;}
    .app-body{display:block;padding:0;max-width:100%;}
    main.mainpanel{box-shadow:none;padding:0;}
    #print-header{display:block !important;margin-bottom:18px;border-bottom:3px solid #2A327B;padding-bottom:10px;}
    #print-header .ph-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
    #print-header img{width:46px;border-radius:6px;}
    #print-header h2{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;}
    #print-header small{color:#555;}
    .year-card-body{display:block !important;}
    .backup-banner{display:none !important;}
  }
</style>

<!-- =========================================================================
     INTEGRACIÓN CON FIREBASE (Firestore + Authentication)
     -------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Estas líneas reemplazan la persistencia local (IndexedDB) por una base
     de datos compartida en la nube (Firestore), y el login por contraseña
     por un inicio de sesión con la cuenta de Google institucional (Google
     Workspace). Así, las 8 personas del EOE ven y editan la MISMA base de
     datos desde cualquier computadora con internet.

     PASOS QUE TENÉS QUE HACER VOS (una sola vez):
     1) Crear un proyecto gratuito en https://console.firebase.google.com
     2) Activar "Firestore Database" (modo producción) y "Authentication"
        → método de acceso "Google".
     3) En "Configuración del proyecto" → "Tus apps" → agregar una app Web,
        copiar el objeto de configuración que te da Firebase y pegarlo acá
        abajo, reemplazando el objeto FIREBASE_CONFIG de ejemplo.
     4) Reemplazar ALLOWED_DOMAIN por el dominio de los emails institucionales
        del colegio (lo que va después de la @ en las cuentas de Workspace).
     Ver la guía paso a paso que te compartí aparte para el detalle completo.
     ========================================================================= -->
